<title>TURKEY: TURKISH ARCELIK H1 NET PROFIT JUMPS.</title>
<headline>TURKISH ARCELIK H1 NET PROFIT JUMPS.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan-June 1997 final</p>
<p>(billion lira unless stated)</p>
<p>				    H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p>				    -------	   -------</p>
<p>    Per share profit (lira)   874.66  vs     515.50</p>
<p>    Net Profit		  8,855.97  vs   3,479.66</p>
<p>    Net sales		  66,643.20  vs  35,978.08</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 14,186.20  vs   6,262.59</p>
<p>    Exceptional income	2,606.65  vs   1,059.21</p>
<p>    Exceptional expense     1,131.69  vs   1,219.20</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     4,069.31  vs   1,757.18</p>
<p>    Total debts		37,942.53  vs  22,453.84</p>
<p>    Equity		     33,214.74  vs  15,671.91</p>
<p>    Capital		    10 125.00  vs   6 750.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Turkey's leading durables producer Arcelik A.S. is largely owned by Koc group, one of Turkey's leading industrial conglomerates.</p>
<p>The figures above do not take into account Turkey's 78 percent year-on-year consumer price inflation in June.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom +90-212 275 08 75</p>
</text>
